The Gigabyte EVGA RTX 2030 Ti (HDCI) is a gaming GeForce RTX 3060 Ti graphics card based on the latest NVMe NV20x architecture that delivers impressive hardware-optimized gaming performance with NVMe 3.1. It’s supported by a highly efficient PCIe 3.0 Gen 1 bus interface and a custom PCIe 3.0 Gen 1 NVLink 3.1. The card provides 4GB+ GDDR6 memory for higher precision graphics with an impressive 10-nm memory module. This makes it an ideal choice for gaming enthusiasts who want maximum performance.
